"[EHL-VAR-001] Source model %(model)s is not in the variation allow-list."
msgstr ""
"[EHL-VAR-001] Le modèle source %(model)s ne figure pas dans la liste "
"d'autorisation des variations."

#. module: eh_log_disputes_variations
#. odoo-python
